Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Episode\NDeadly Challenge\NMartial Arts Tournament Volume
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done!\NEnough with the training dummies today!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So exhausting...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Prince!\NI was watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.86,0:02:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Your master is using a real\Nsword for practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.30,0:02:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It is indeed very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.54,0:03:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, since when do they use\Nreal swords for training?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, Grand Duke, you see...\N- You are fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Begone!\N- At your command!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, for tomorrow I have\Norganized a grand tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you are here,\Nwould you like to participate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The most skilled knights\Nwho tread our lands will participate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.78,0:03:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Officer of the guard, announce me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! This knight\Nseems really very strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,People of the castle, make way\Nfor the certain winner of the tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will manage to defeat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.62,0:03:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Ruffians!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this how you treat the best\Nknight you invited?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.06,0:03:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Even worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.22,0:03:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I disqualify you for incompetence!\NGo back to your lands!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.74,0:03:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Baron! I have come\Nfor the tournament! How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help! Go away!\N- You will be convinced, I hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- that I am the strongest!\N- It will be difficult to beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.82,0:04:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This knight has what it takes\Nto win the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He will surely also win the challenge\Nagainst Sapphire and kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.74,0:04:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill Sapphire?! I must warn him\Nof the danger he is facing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.98,0:04:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Stork friends, I need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:05:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They will be fights to the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever wins will have\Nto be an exceptional man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They have come from the furthest\Nlands!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.78,0:05:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Much blood will flow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be tough for everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the favorite\Nwill be a certain Baron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.86,0:05:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling they\Nwon't let children in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hide in here and\Nenter with this lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's stealing my lunch!\NLittle thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard, I am the knight Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.94,0:05:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, knight!\NPlease, enter!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.22,0:05:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be the only one to come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the knight Guillon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to participate\Nin the tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.34,0:05:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- And I will win it!\N- Well, you are here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.18,0:05:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look!\NMy dear enemy Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you hope to win?\N- The scar you gave me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,..cries out for revenge! I can't wait\Nto run you through with my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.18,0:05:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The hatred I bear you for the mark\Nthat you left on my face...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,..makes me wish for\Nthe very same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill two birds with one stone:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.66,0:06:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will send you to hell\Nand I will win the tournament too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.06,0:06:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Easier said than done!\N- And easy to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.62,0:06:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They scare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Prince Sapphire!\NI thank all the knights..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...who have gathered for this tournament.\NI will fight you as equals!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be deceived\Nby my apparent fragility
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,nor by the fact\Nthat I am only a boy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,nor have any qualms about fighting\Nagainst a Prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,because I am much stronger\Nthan I appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is there to laugh about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.62,0:06:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You are very strong\Nfor a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.02,0:06:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You had better not laugh anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That fool of a Prince\Ndoesn't know how dangerous it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.30,0:06:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...to provoke those knights!\NNow, without a doubt, one of them
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.34,0:07:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,..can't wait\Nto tear him to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I declare open\Nthe Silverland tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin\Nwill present the competition!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.14,0:07:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends...\NWhat do you want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.86,0:07:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you all the best of luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.74,0:07:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And expressing the thoughts\Nof the Prince and myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I urge you to fight\Nto the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We will immediately begin the tournament\Nwith three elimination rounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who emerge as victors\Nwill be admitted to the final challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck to you, knights
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The knight missed two shots!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The next contestant\Nis Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, Sapphire!\NIf you make it to the final contest,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.22,0:08:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- you will be killed by the knights!\N- Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire\Nhas missed two...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.30,0:08:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't miss a single shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they will take him out...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.94,0:08:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Also qualifying is\Nthe knight Guillon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.10,0:08:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The second round,\Ngentlewomen and noblemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,consists of the shooting contest\Nwith the crossbow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prince\Nhas hit the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The next challenge will consist\Nof the axe throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.10,0:09:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, he did it!\NIt's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Hello, Tink! What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You are so dirty\Nthat I have to wash you a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see the tournament?\NIt went well for me, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you should be\Nvery happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, it would be better\Nif you withdrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.26,0:10:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your head and stomach\Nhappen to hurt a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Tink,\Nbut I feel perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.34,0:10:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, it would be better for you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why are you telling me this?\N- They will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that Duralumin wants to have me\Nkilled during the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And isn't that a good reason\Nto give it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll survive, don't worry
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.46,0:10:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you participate\Nin the final race!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There are seven knights who have\Npassed the qualifiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.86,0:10:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They are about to\Nfight for the final victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.18,0:10:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They will certainly be\Nstrong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.78,0:10:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes! Strong enough\Nfor the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sure that one of them will certainly\Nend up defeating him, Grand Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But from the first matches we've\Nseen that Prince Sapphire, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...is rather strong,\Nso we cannot be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see this bag of gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grand Duke will give it to\Nwhoever eliminates all the opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have participated in many\Ntournaments and I have always won.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then would you be willing\Nto do a favor for the Grand Duke,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.90,0:11:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- by killing one of the competitors?\N- Of course! And who would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.90,0:11:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- The boy, Prince Sapphire.\N- The Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.54,0:11:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are two bags!\NIf you kill him, you will have more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can give them to me right now,\Nbecause I will kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.02,0:11:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sir Baron, you disappoint me.\N- And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.34,0:11:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you kill an opponent\Nfor a bit of vile money?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a professional\Nand I am at the service of whoever pays me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercenaries like you are not\Nworthy of fighting with knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:12:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Do you want a lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.06,0:12:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- See you soon, Baron!\N- Damned Guillon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Knights,\Nhere we are at the grand finale!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I warn you that from now on you can\Nkill your opponent...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.58,0:12:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,.without being punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.58,0:12:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first match, on this\Nside, the knight Mustang,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.66,0:12:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,on this other side, His Highness\NPrince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, don't go! He will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.26,0:12:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Tink!\NYou'll see I'll make it! Move aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, are you fighting without a helmet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Presumptuous daredevil!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Opal! Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.34,0:12:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll fall to the ground at the first impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A tough one, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.94,0:13:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.74,0:13:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You are defeated, Mustang!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I won, Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The next clash will take place\Nbetween knights Baron and Hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.78,0:13:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He is certainly dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The next challenge will be held\Nbetween knights Guillon and Napal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.74,0:14:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Voilà!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.02,0:14:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And this one is dead too
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The next fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,\Nthe fight has already taken place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.74,0:14:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,These challenges are truly\Nto the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.22,0:14:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are afraid,\Nyou can withdraw from the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- I won't back down!\N- If you want, feel free to withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't dig your heels in\Nout of pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.78,0:14:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- But I want to...\N- Sapphire, don't fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Shut up, Tink!\N- Sapphire, please don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! I didn't come\Nto watch the tournament...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...because I was too afraid\Nthat something would happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.94,0:14:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, be satisfied\Nwith having already won the other contests.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Withdraw from the final!\N- Listen, mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Prince and, if I give up\Nfighting for the victory,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,our subjects will laugh at me!\Nand besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.38,0:14:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- What else is there?\N- I want to have proof..
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.74,0:14:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...that Grand Duke Duralumin\Nintends to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?\NYou shouldn't say such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish so much that you would\Nthink only about studying...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...to become a good Prince\Nand not about fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.70,0:15:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you. What will I\Ndo if you are defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, take my advice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I promise you that after tomorrow's\Ncontest I will go back to studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,May God bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- I will return, mother!\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.18,0:15:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord of heaven, I beg you,\Nprotect her! Make her return!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.02,0:15:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we will form the\Npairings for the two semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The two who draw the\Nsame card will face each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here is mine!\N- Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.70,0:15:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see, now, Baron's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- We'll settle this between us, Baron!\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.50,0:15:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm supposed to face\Na boy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.74,0:16:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Surrender!\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.38,0:16:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I won, Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn him!\NHe made it this time too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.22,0:16:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You must declare me the winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- I am forced to...\N- What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I'll have to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.34,0:16:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire has won!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.86,0:16:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now it's our turn, Baron!\N- Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.10,0:16:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.74,0:16:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Referee!\N- At your command!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the tournament!\NI have to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.74,0:16:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good!\N- This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:16:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Grand Duke! Say it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.54,0:17:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... The fact is\Nthat Baron and Guillon...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.26,0:17:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...have already faced each other 7 times\Nand have always ended in a draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.66,0:17:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can I have some more?\N- Yes, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.62,0:17:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, continue!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This time too\Nthey won't be able to best each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is serious.\N- Only this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.34,0:17:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...they will fight to the death\Nand they will both die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,First, the old man said\Nthat each of those two...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...has developed\Nhis own secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.22,0:17:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This means there won't be\Nanyone who can kill the Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.38,0:17:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...if both of them die!\N- You are right, that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.26,0:17:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So first we will have to\Nkill one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Guillon hasn't arrived yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.02,0:17:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The competition is almost about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.90,0:17:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grand Duke asked me\Nto come down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.78,0:17:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows why he wants\Nto meet me in the dungeons...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.14,0:17:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it: they want to\Nstop me from winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, Guillon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:17:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I will sell my life dearly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You may eliminate me,\Nbut I will kill many of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.14,0:18:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You have proven you are\Nworth as much as the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no need\Nfor you to fight anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can no longer back\Ndown! I would lose face!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Scoundrels!\N- You're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.90,0:18:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You are finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.26,0:18:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned bandits!\NYou'll see who Guillon is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Forward!\N- Ready? Pour!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.50,0:18:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Not the boiling oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run! It burns! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell into a trap! Who\Ndid such a terrible thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:18:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You say Guillon has fled?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.86,0:18:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Probably he must\Nhave been afraid of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.10,0:19:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!\NI know Guillon well!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He is not a coward! He is brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.26,0:19:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet we cannot find him\Nanywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.62,0:19:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you will fight in\Nthe final match against the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.66,0:19:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I am very perplexed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grand Duke will give you twenty\Ntimes more than what he promised you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron, did you have\NGuillon killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.22,0:19:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but I could kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.90,0:19:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You are unfair to attack me\Nlike this! I am not ready yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.38,0:19:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let the final begin!\N- The final already?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.26,0:19:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- How come?\N- Guillon has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.18,0:19:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Guillon has been killed!\N- What do you mean he's been killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.86,0:19:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You set a trap for him,\Ndidn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.06,0:19:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be foolish!\NI would never do such a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.74,0:19:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope they don't discover\Nthe truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.86,0:19:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you were afraid of Guillon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.86,0:19:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- He feared me too!\N- You are a miserable individual:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.06,0:19:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,having an opponent attacked\Nin the castle dungeons...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap in the dungeons?\NNow I understand everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.14,0:20:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The Baron and the Grand Duke\Neliminated Guillon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...so that I would kill the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for my attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- The boy is not bad!\N- It's over for Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.06,0:20:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, kill him! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.70,0:20:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, it went wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserved defeat, Baron,\Nbecause you are nothing but a schemer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.54,0:20:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I only want to tell you one thing,\NPrince:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You are an idiot! It wasn't me\Nwho killed Guillon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.82,0:20:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Around you live people\Nwho try by every means...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.26,0:20:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...to snatch your throne\Nand your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:20:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, if it wasn't you,\Nwho was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.26,0:21:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Know that when I realized\Nwho had killed Guillon,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- I pretended to lose the race!\N- You could have beaten me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- No one has succeeded! - You have\Ntoo high an opinion of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.02,0:21:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they say that I am presumptuous?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!\NBaron, we will meet again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Nylon wants to speak with you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron, you let yourself be beaten\Ndespite your promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give me my money back! - I\Nhave no use for your money!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I will kill you\Nto avenge Guillon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.02,0:21:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.14,0:21:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, henchmen, step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:22:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward! Forward! Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.90,0:22:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.66,0:22:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!\NI was certain you would return!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.22,0:22:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stomach\Nthat you let yourself be beaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.18,0:22:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I challenge you once more\Nto single combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.74,0:22:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be enough for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you draw your sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.82,0:22:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.42,0:22:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you satisfied? If instead of\Na stick I had had a sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.18,0:22:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have cut off your head
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.22,0:22:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a professional, Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.90,0:22:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Practice and become stronger,\Notherwise you will lose your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.78,0:22:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You are strong and brave\Nfor being only a boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but to defeat\Nthe scoundrels of this kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...you will have to become\Neven more skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.10,0:22:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.66,0:23:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I will remember this lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.42,0:23:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Knight Baron.
